Any of the following:
(a) a condition of the export licence has been contravened, or it is likely that such a condition will be contravened;
(b) the holder has not complied, or is likely not to comply, with a requirement of this Act;
(c) particular regulated waste material, or a kind of regulated waste material, covered by the licence does not comply, or is not likely to comply, with a requirement of this Act that applies in relation to the waste material

The following persons:
